+            priority if exits: 1) specific layer input +  basis 2) X_ + basis 3) basis. E.g. if basis is PCA, `scatters`
+            is going to look for 1) if specific layer is spliced, `spliced_pca` 2) `X_pca` (dynamo convention) 3) `pca`.
+            Defaults to "umap".
